{
  "$schema": "https://aka.ms/codetour-schema",
  "title": "16 - Tests and observability",
  "description": "How you know it works: E2E and Python tests, CI, LangSmith tracing, cost tracking, analytics and health checks.",
  "nextTour": "17 - Billing, invites and admin",
